Z||000004||Oreif||03-18-2000||01:22 AM||||The emblem on the map pockets was on the leather accent group for 86 thru 87 SE's and GT's. I'm not sure about 85 or 88 GT's.<BR>If you have the leather emblem and a horizontal accent stripe on your seats, leather wrapped steering wheel, and leather shifter handle, you should have emblems on the map pockets too!||||reg||1
