Z||000006||sid1200||03-18-2000||05:01 AM||||no emblems on the 88's, I think GM was seeing the 90's trend to a smoother look with less emblems etc, thus eliminating the 2 tone, and all the inside emblems such as the seat trim and emblems and the mirror pockets. only emblems on the 88's are the steering wheel, door locks, and a printed light emblem on the front map pocket (glove box location), this is on the front of it, not the back as in the 85-87 GT's||||reg||1
Z||000007||Monkeyman||03-18-2000||08:17 AM||||No emblems on the map pockets or seats of the Grape Ape ('85 GT).||||reg||1
